                "text": "In 2021, youth aged 13-24 accounted for 19% of new HIV diagnoses in the United States.\n\nAs a member of the @EqualityCaucus, I am working with my colleagues to expand access to HIV/AIDS testing and treatment. It is essential for our young people to get the care they need. https://t.co/BbpjqzTGHI",
